                                "sense_id": "077de18c-c120-3fb7-a338-b90589954e33",
                                "text": "1989, Down East, The Magazine of Maine, Volume 35, Issues 6-11, page 8,\nThe food is as good as people deserve who are willing to eat in such restaurants. Their menus are designed not to offend even the most wambly of tourists."
